{
  "name": "zovo-vba-viewer",
  "displayName": "VBA Viewer & Macro Extractor",
  "description": "VBA viewer for VS Code: open the macros inside .xlsm, .xlsb, .xls, .docm, .doc, .pptm, .ppt and vbaProject.bin files without Office, with every module, its source in color, search and module details. Read-only; no macro runs.",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "publisher": "zovo",
  "license": "MIT",
  "icon": "icon.png",
  "galleryBanner": {
    "color": "#1E2A22",
    "theme": "dark"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/theluckystrike/vba-viewer-vscode"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/theluckystrike/vba-viewer-vscode/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/theluckystrike/vba-viewer-vscode#readme",
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.75.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Visualization",
    "Other"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "vba",
    "excel macro",
    "xlsm",
    "macro",
    "office"
  ],
  "main": "./src/extension.js",
  "activationEvents": [
    "onUri"
  ],
  "capabilities": {
    "untrustedWorkspaces": {
      "supported": true
    },
    "virtualWorkspaces": true
  },
  "contributes": {
    "customEditors": [
      {
        "viewType": "vbaViewer.project",
        "displayName": "VBA Viewer",
        "selector": [
          {
            "filenamePattern": "vbaProject.bin"
          }
        ],
        "priority": "default"
      },
      {
        "viewType": "vbaViewer.macros",
        "displayName": "VBA Viewer (macros)",
        "selector": [
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.xlsm"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.xlsb"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.xls"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.xltm"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.xlam"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.docm"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.dotm"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.doc"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.pptm"
          },
          {
            "filenamePattern": "*.ppt"
          }
        ],
        "priority": "option"
      }
    ],
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.openMacros",
        "title": "Open VBA Macros",
        "category": "VBA Viewer",
        "icon": "$(symbol-method)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.openDefault",
        "title": "Reopen with the Default Editor",
        "category": "VBA Viewer",
        "icon": "$(go-to-file)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.openSample",
        "title": "Open the Sample Workbook",
        "category": "VBA Viewer"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.openWalkthrough",
        "title": "Get Started",
        "category": "VBA Viewer"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.moreViewers",
        "title": "More free tools by Zovo",
        "category": "VBA Viewer"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.supportDeveloper",
        "title": "Support the developer",
        "category": "VBA Viewer"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.exportModules",
        "title": "Export All Modules (Pro)",
        "category": "VBA Viewer",
        "icon": "$(export)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.scan",
        "title": "Macro Security Scan (Pro)",
        "category": "VBA Viewer",
        "icon": "$(shield)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.compare",
        "title": "Compare Macros with Another File (Pro)",
        "category": "VBA Viewer",
        "icon": "$(diff)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.zovoPro.exportModules",
        "title": "Zovo Pro: Export all modules"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.zovoPro.scan",
        "title": "Zovo Pro: Macro security scan"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.zovoPro.compare",
        "title": "Zovo Pro: Compare macros"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.getPro",
        "title": "Get Zovo Pro (USD 19 once, all 22 Zovo extensions)",
        "category": "Zovo Pro"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.payWithPayPal",
        "title": "Pay for Zovo Pro with PayPal (USD 19, team of 5 USD 59)",
        "category": "Zovo Pro"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.unlockWithSponsors",
        "title": "I already paid: unlock with GitHub Sponsors",
        "category": "Zovo Pro"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.enterLicenseKey",
        "title": "Enter Zovo Pro license key",
        "category": "Zovo Pro"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.removeLicense",
        "title": "Remove Zovo Pro from this editor",
        "category": "Zovo Pro"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.payByCard",
        "title": "Pay for Zovo Pro by card (USD 19)",
        "category": "Zovo Pro"
      },
      {
        "command": "vbaViewer.enterKey",
        "title": "Enter a key",
        "category": "Zovo Pro"
      }
    ],
    "menus": {
      "editor/title": [
        {
          "command": "vbaViewer.openMacros",
          "when": "(resourceExtname =~ /^\\.(xlsm|xlsb|xls|xltm|xlam|docm|dotm|doc|pptm|ppt)$/i || resourceFilename =~ /^vbaproject\\.bin$/i) && activeCustomEditorId != 'vbaViewer.project' && activeCustomEditorId != 'vbaViewer.macros'",
          "group": "navigation@9"
        },
        {
          "command": "vbaViewer.openDefault",
          "when": "activeCustomEditorId == 'vbaViewer.macros'",
          "group": "navigation@9"
        },
        {
          "command": "vbaViewer.exportModules",
          "when": "(activeCustomEditorId == 'vbaViewer.project' || activeCustomEditorId == 'vbaViewer.macros') && config.vbaViewer.showProTools",
          "group": "1_vba@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "vbaViewer.scan",
          "when": "(activeCustomEditorId == 'vbaViewer.project' || activeCustomEditorId == 'vbaViewer.macros') && config.vbaViewer.showProTools",
          "group": "1_vba@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "vbaViewer.compare",
          "when": "(activeCustomEditorId == 'vbaViewer.project' || activeCustomEditorId == 'vbaViewer.macros') && config.vbaViewer.showProTools",
          "group": "1_vba@3"
        }
      ],
      "explorer/context": [
        {
          "command": "vbaViewer.openMacros",
          "when": "(resourceExtname =~ /^\\.(xlsm|xlsb|xls|xltm|xlam|docm|dotm|doc|pptm|ppt)$/i || resourceFilename =~ /^vbaproject\\.bin$/i) && !explorerResourceIsFolder",
          "group": "navigation@9"
        },
        {
          "command": "vbaViewer.zovoPro.exportModules",
          "when": "(resourceExtname =~ /^\\.(xlsm|xlsb|xls|xltm|xlam|docm|dotm|doc|pptm|ppt)$/i || resourceFilename =~ /^vbaproject\\.bin$/i) && !explorerResourceIsFolder && config.vbaViewer.showProTools",
          "group": "zovoPro@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "vbaViewer.zovoPro.scan",
          "when": "(resourceExtname =~ /^\\.(xlsm|xlsb|xls|xltm|xlam|docm|dotm|doc|pptm|ppt)$/i || resourceFilename =~ /^vbaproject\\.bin$/i) && !explorerResourceIsFolder && config.vbaViewer.showProTools",
          "group": "zovoPro@2"
        },
        {
          "command": "vbaViewer.zovoPro.compare",
          "when": "(resourceExtname =~ /^\\.(xlsm|xlsb|xls|xltm|xlam|docm|dotm|doc|pptm|ppt)$/i || resourceFilename =~ /^vbaproject\\.bin$/i) && !explorerResourceIsFolder && config.vbaViewer.showProTools",
          "group": "zovoPro@3"
        }
      ],
      "commandPalette": [
        {
          "command": "vbaViewer.openDefault",
          "when": "(activeCustomEditorId == 'vbaViewer.project' || activeCustomEditorId == 'vbaViewer.macros')"
        },
        {
          "command": "vbaViewer.exportModules",
          "when": "config.vbaViewer.showProTools"
        },
        {
          "command": "vbaViewer.scan",
          "when": "config.vbaViewer.showProTools"
        },
        {
          "command": "vbaViewer.compare",
          "when": "config.vbaViewer.showProTools"
        },
        {
          "command": "vbaViewer.zovoPro.exportModules",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "vbaViewer.zovoPro.scan",
          "when": "false"
        },
        {
          "command": "vbaViewer.zovoPro.compare",
          "when": "false"
        }
      ]
    },
    "configuration": {
      "title": "VBA Viewer",
      "properties": {
        "vbaViewer.showAttributes": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "description": "Show the hidden \"Attribute VB_...\" lines in the source view. The VBA editor in Office hides them; exported files always keep them."
        },
        "vbaViewer.exportEncoding": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "utf8",
            "codepage"
          ],
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "UTF-8 text, best for git and diff tools.",
            "The project's own Windows code page (for example 1252), as the VBA editor writes and imports .bas files. Only single-byte code pages; others fall back to UTF-8."
          ],
          "default": "utf8",
          "description": "Text encoding of the .bas, .cls and .frm files that Export all modules writes."
        },
        "vbaViewer.maxFileSizeMB": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 200,
          "minimum": 1,
          "description": "Files larger than this open with a message instead of being read, so VS Code stays responsive."
        },
        "vbaViewer.showProTools": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Show the Zovo Pro tools (export all modules, macro security scan, compare macros) in the Command Palette, the Explorer menu and the viewer toolbar. Everything free stays visible."
        },
        "vbaViewer.askForRating": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Ask once for a Marketplace rating after files opened without an error on two occasions at least 30 minutes apart. \"Later\" asks one more time after 7 days, \"No thanks\" never asks again. Nothing is sent anywhere."
        },
        "vbaViewer.showSupportLinks": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "Show the small Rate, More free tools and Zovo Pro links at the bottom of the viewer. Nothing is sent anywhere."
        }
      }
    },
    "walkthroughs": [
      {
        "id": "vbaViewer.start",
        "title": "Get started with the VBA Viewer",
        "description": "Read the VBA macros inside Office files in VS Code, without Office.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "id": "open",
            "title": "Open the macros of an Office file",
            "description": "Right-click an .xlsm, .xls, .docm, .doc, .pptm or .ppt file in the Explorer and choose Open VBA Macros. A vbaProject.bin file opens in the viewer by default. Nothing runs: the macros are read as text.\n[Open the sample workbook](command:vbaViewer.openSample)",
            "media": {
              "image": "images/screenshot.png",
              "altText": "The sample workbook open in the VBA Viewer: the module list, the source of a module with line numbers and colors, and the module details."
            },
            "completionEvents": [
              "onCommand:vbaViewer.openSample"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "search",
            "title": "Search every module at once",
            "description": "Type in the search box of the viewer to find a word in all modules. Click a result to jump to that line. The details panel shows the module type, its size, its attributes and its procedures.",
            "media": {
              "markdown": "walkthrough/search.md"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "zovo-related",
            "title": "Tools for the rest of the file",
            "description": "The sheets, documents and slides around the macros open in these free Zovo extensions. A link opens the extension page, and you choose there whether to install it.\n[XLSX Viewer](command:extension.open?%5B%22zovo.table-viewer-vscode%22%5D)\n[DOCX Viewer](command:extension.open?%5B%22zovo.docx-viewer-vscode%22%5D)\n[PPTX Viewer](command:extension.open?%5B%22zovo.pptx-slide-viewer%22%5D)\n[Hex Viewer](command:extension.open?%5B%22zovo.zovo-hex-viewer%22%5D)",
            "media": {
              "markdown": "walkthrough/related.md"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node scripts/test.js",
    "package": "npx -y @vscode/vsce@3 package --no-dependencies"
  },
  "devDependencies": {},
  "sponsor": {
    "url": "https://github.com/sponsors/theluckystrike/sponsorships?tier_id=679878"
  }
}
